# Pokemon Emerald — heavy diff (40% of 16KB blocks XOR'd with PRNG)
# Formats that need a ≤16 MB ROM (IPS 24-bit ceiling, EBP/IPS-based,
# APS-GBA format-specific). Stadium2 covers everything else.

base:   test/data/emerald/base.gba
