desc:   emerald heavy-diff (16 MB GBA, IPS/EBP/APS-GBA/NINJA1)

IPS      | test/data/emerald/heavy-diff/patch.ips       | synthetic | Flips
EBP      | test/data/emerald/heavy-diff/patch.ebp       | synthetic | RomPatcher.js
APS-GBA  | test/data/emerald/heavy-diff/patch.aps       | synthetic | RomPatcher.js (type=0)
NINJA1   | test/data/emerald/heavy-diff/patch.ninja1    | synthetic | slap (pending replacement with externally-created patch)
